<title>AUSTRIA: WIFO details Austria growth forecast for 96, 97.</title>
<headline>WIFO details Austria growth forecast for 96, 97.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following are details of research institute WIFO's most recent forecasts for the Austrian economy, published on Friday.</p>
<p>			     (percentage change versus previous year)</p>
<p>				    1995	1996	    1997</p>
<p> Real GDP growth		 1.8	0.7	     1.0</p>
<p> Private consumption	   1.9	1.0 (0.8)     0.3</p>
<p> Gross investments	     2.3	0.7 (0.6)     1.2</p>
<p> Exports			   8.1	4.0 (4.5)     5.5</p>
<p> Imports			   6.8	2.8 (2.2)     3.0</p>
<p> Current account (bln ats) -47.3    -44.4 (-40.8) -25.8 (-22.3)</p>
<p> Consumer price infl (pct)   2.2	1.7	     1.7</p>
<p> Unemployment (pct)	    6.6	7.1 (7.3)     7.5 (7.7)</p>
<p>NOTE - Previous forecasts in brackets where there is a revision.</p>
<p>NOTE - Unemployment according to Austrian Labour Service standards. According to European standards 1995 unemployment 3.9 percent, 1996 4.0 percent, 1997 4.2 percent. -- Vienna Newsroom 43-1-531 12 254</p>
</text>
